                        "field":  "rule",
                        "proposed":  "RENAME:synchronization-sovereign is canonically renamed automation-sovereign; DISPLAY:自動主宰; IDENTITY:automation-sovereign is the sole active identity and inherits without expansion every former synchronization-sovereign duty,power,restriction,child relationship,module decision assignment,contract,receipt and lineage; RETIREMENT:the former name is a historical deprecated alias only and cannot authenticate,decide,receive assignment or coexist as an active sovereign; SCOPE:automation-sovereign decides automation synchronization,resource convergence,channel continuity,state convergence,release/update transactions,repair/backup,cleanup/retention,automatic logging and dependency coordination directly through its managed modules,excluding learning duties transferred to 星澄 by A124; EXECUTION:its exceptional certified update execution remains limited exactly by C52 and all other execution stays with registered module executors; MIGRATION:all current registries,contracts,metadata,rosters,module assignments,permission viewers and machine references resolve to automation-sovereign; compatibility input using the old alias must resolve one-way to automation-sovereign during a registered bounded migration and output only the canonical identity.\\n\\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
