                        "field":  "rule",
                        "proposed":  "COLLABORATION-UNIT:task-envelope{task-id,request-id,origin,objective,scope,priority,deadline,dependency-set,input-contract,expected-output,assigned-owner,participant-list,runtime-generation,release-id,state-sequence,correlation-id}; ENTRY:all-sovereign-requests/events/results/decisions/proofs through-information-layer-official-entry; ORCHESTRATION:decision-sovereign decomposes-task+selects-one-accountable-domain-owner+declares-participants/dependencies/acceptance-criteria+validates-assignment; DOMAIN-VERDICT:each-specialized-sovereign decides-only-its-declared-domain and returns typed approve/deny/defer-with-reason/evidence/constraints/expiry; PERMISSION:permission-sovereign independently validates-identity/action/target/scope/purpose and denial-is-not-overridable-by-other-sovereign; CHANNEL:automation-sovereign manages-topology/routing/contracts/delivery-health modules but cannot-read-beyond-grant/change-content/choose-business-outcome; EXECUTION:runtime-sovereign validates-complete-proof-set/runtime-readiness then dispatches-to-governed-executor and verifies-result; STARTUP:system-runtime-sovereign coordinates-boot-only within its own startup phase and retains verified-readiness ownership; HEALTH:decision-sovereign observes-health+opens-bounded-maintenance-request; repair/code-change requires-decision-assignment+permission-proof+automation-sovereign-review-and-dispatch+runtime-validation; LEARNING:星澄 receives-redacted-outcomes+proposes-candidates-only and cannot-change-routing/policy/code/runtime; RESOURCE/DATA/THIRD-PARTY/LANGUAGE:former decision identities are retired; resource/dependency modules are managed by automation-sovereign and data-governance modules by decision-sovereign and language conformance+code authoring+automation coordination exclusively by 星澄 native model and auxiliary system under B69 boundaries; each core never-performs-another-domain-duty; 星澄:exclusive whole-system automation coordinator+programming/language-review native capability and may command governed tools/modules within valid user/Codex authorization; CODEX:protects-codex-integrity only and is-not-operational-workflow-coordinator; STATE-MACHINE:received\u003eassignment-validated\u003edomain-checks-pending\u003epermission-validated\u003eexecution-validated\u003edispatched\u003eresult-verified\u003ecompleted|denied|failed|expired; CONCURRENCY:independent-domain-checks parallel-after-assignment+dependent-gates serial+result-join requires-all-mandatory-current proofs; DELIVERY:at-least-once-transport+idempotency-key+deduplication+monotonic-per-task-sequence+acknowledgement; FAILURE:timeout/disconnect/stale-generation/schema-failure/missing-proof=\u003etyped-fail-closed-state+bounded-retry-with-jitter+resume-from-last-verified-checkpoint+audit; RECOVERY:reconnect reauthenticates+renews-subscription+replays-from-last-acknowledged-sequence+reconciles-snapshot-before-new-command; OBSERVABILITY:one-correlation-chain+owner/participant/timestamps/decision/proof/state-transition/latency/retry visible-at-authorized-level; FINALITY:accountable-owner accepts-domain-result+decision-sovereign accepts-cross-domain-task-completion without-overriding-domain-or-permission-denial\\n\\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
