                        "field":  "rule",
                        "proposed":  "SCOPE:backend source/configuration/contract/module changes while any certified system generation is running; OWNER:automation-sovereign reviews change+decision-sovereign classifies health+permission-sovereign authorizes+runtime-sovereign activates only a certified generation; CONTINUITY:editing staging compiling testing or rejecting candidate code cannot stop block restart disconnect degrade or mutate the active generation; ISOLATION:candidate workspace+module namespace+dependency graph+configuration+cache+database migration preparation and validation are separate from active runtime; PREFLIGHT:parse/type/contract/dependency/import/permission/resource/state-migration/rollback checks complete before activation; ACTIVATION:atomic generation pointer transition at safe boundary+in-flight request drain or checkpoint+old generation remains serviceable until successor readiness proven; FAILURE:any candidate error leaves active generation byte/state/session/release identity unchanged and quarantines candidate with typed evidence; HOT-RELOAD:only compatible certified modules+transactional module snapshot+ordered dependency reload+rollback all attempted modules on first fault; INCOMPATIBLE-CHANGE:blue-green successor generation+fresh session generation+state/outbox/cursor reconciliation before traffic switch; CHANNEL:heartbeat/ack/reconnect/control processing retains reserved capacity and cannot execute candidate compilation or heavy status assembly; RECOVERY:backend crash uses last active certified release never uncommitted candidate and preserves frontend host plus independent tools; SUCCESS:no lost acknowledged event+no duplicate side effect+no stale result+active release and runtime generation verified throughout stability window\\n\\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
