                        "field":  "rule",
                        "proposed":  "HEALTH-STATES:healthy|degraded|recovering|critical|unknown; DIMENSIONS:governance-integrity+process-survival+runtime-readiness+dependency-readiness+information-channel-continuity+data-integrity+resource-headroom+security-signals+clock-validity+backup-recoverability; EACH-COMPONENT-HEALTH-CONTRACT:owner+typed-signals+sampling-or-event-source+thresholds+staleness-limit+dependency-map+severity+recovery-objective; MONITOR:continuous-events+bounded-active-probes+debounce+hysteresis+trend-detection; HEALTH-OWNER:decision-sovereign classifies health and preserves+coordinates-maintenance; PREVENTION:capacity-headroom+dependency-renewal+stale-state-reconciliation+bounded-housekeeping+verified-update-readiness; AUTOMATIC-PRESERVATION:signal\u003einformation-layer\u003emaintenance-classification\u003edecision\u003epermission-validation\u003eruntime-dispatch-or-automation-sovereign-dispatch\u003egoverned-executor\u003eindependent-verification\u003estability-window\u003einformation-layer-status+audit\u003e星澄-card-and-active-ui; RECOVERY-POLICY:idempotent+bounded-attempts+backoff+circuit-breaker+rollback-or-quarantine+preserve-user-work; SUCCESS:all-required-signals-current+thresholds-satisfied+independent-verification+declared-stability-window; FAILURE:critical-or-unknown+fail-closed-for-affected-capability+retain-evidence+user-notification+learning-outcome\\n\\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
