                        "field":  "rule",
                        "proposed":  "CONNECTION-DEFINITION:any-cross-process+cross-thread-message-channel+cross-layer+cross-module+cross-owner+frontend-backend+sovereign-module+module-executor+network+loopback+LAN+internet+WebSocket+HTTP/HTTPS+TCP/UDP+IPC+pipe+queue+event-bus+callback-bus+database+PostgreSQL+SQLite-cross-owner+Rust-Vector-Engine+RAG+Ollama+model-runtime+filesystem-cross-owner+repository+broker+tool+service+child-process-control+health-probe+administration+provisioning+startup+repair+test-or-script communication/session/request/read/write/control/status/event/data-transfer; SOLE-OWNER:information-layer; REQUIRED-ROUTE:authenticated-requester\u003eregistered-information-layer-entry\u003eauthorization+type+contract+scope+rate+observability+audit-gates\u003einformation-layer-owned-transport-adapter\u003eauthorized-destination\u003etyped-result-via-information-layer; PHYSICAL-CONNECTION:may-be-opened-only-by-information-layer-owned-adapter-on-behalf-of-approved-request+adapter-has-no-domain-decision; CREDENTIALS+TOKENS+PORTS+CONNECTION-POOLS+SESSIONS+RETRY+TIMEOUT+HEARTBEAT+BACKPRESSURE+RECONNECT:information-layer-custody; CALLER:request-only+no-transport-handle; DESTINATION:reply-only-through-originating-information-route; FAILURE:fail-closed+typed-error+audit+health-signal; COVERAGE:runtime+development+maintenance+migration+packaging+diagnostics+tests+one-off-scripts; INTERNAL-NON-CONNECTION:pure-in-process-function-call-inside-one-owner-and-one-layer-without-I/O/message/session/transport-handle remains-owner-internal; CURRENT-NORMALIZATION:C116 controls;SQLite is retired with zero active consumers;every affirmative SQLite use,fallback,reconciliation,authority or runtime clause in this provision is void and historical-only"
