                                },
                        "field":  "rule",
                        "proposed":  "CANONICAL-CODE-ROOT:DIR[DIR_PROJECT_ROOT]; SCOPE:all-GPTBridge-owned/authored/copied/generated/transformed/downloaded/vendored/patched/extracted/staged/executable project source+scripts+modules+packages+plugins+extensions+hooks+launchers+workers+migrations+code-templates+embedded-code+build-inputs+runtime-loaded-code+hot-update/hot-reload artifacts+test-code+repair-code+AI/programming-tool output+Git-worktrees/object-database/index/hooks; LOCATION-RULE:every-in-scope path after absolute-normalization+case-folding+drive-resolution+environment-expansion+short-name-resolution+symlink/junction/mount/reparse-target-resolution must-equal-root or be-strict-descendant-of-root; ROOT-BOUNDARY:path-component boundary not-string-prefix; DIRECTORY-AUTHORITY:permission-sovereign registers-all-approved-code-directories under-root only; PROGRAMMING:automation-sovereign may-plan/dispatch changes only-to-registered-descendants; EXECUTION:runtime-sovereign validates executable/module/script/working-directory/import/search/plugin/temp-generated-code paths before-dispatch; INFORMATION-LAYER:rejects cross-root code transfer/write/extract/load/execute requests+publishes typed-denial; GIT:main-repository+.git+all-worktrees+shared-object-database+hooks must-reside-within-root+external-worktree-path forbidden; GENERATION:temporary/generated/build/package/cache/coverage/test/recovery/repair code stored only-in-approved-root descendants+atomic-promote-within-same-boundary; IMPORT/PATH:PYTHONPATH/NODE_PATH/PATH/plugin/module-resolution cannot introduce GPTBridge project code from outside-root; ARCHIVE:pre-scan+canonicalize-each-entry+reject-absolute/parent-traversal/reparse/hardlink escape before-extract; HOT-UPDATE/REPAIR:source+staging+rollback+active-release all-inside-root and D28/D29 identity rules still-apply; AUDIT:operation+actor+requested-path+resolved-path+root+decision+content-hash+timestamp+correlation-id without-secret; CHECKPOINTS:startup+code-change+tool-call+Git-operation+dependency-install+generation+build+test+package+hot-update+repair+runtime-load; FAILURE:any-unresolved/ambiguous/nonexistent-parent/reparse-loop/case-alias/device-path/network-path/outside-root=\u003efail-closed+no-create/write/copy/move/load/import/execute+report-to-user; EXISTING-OUTSIDE-CODE:quarantine-reference+do-not-load+move requires-explicit-governed migration that first validates-destination-inside-root and never-deletes-source-until-hash-verified; THIRD-PARTY-BOUNDARY:operating-system executables and externally-installed immutable third-party runtimes are-not-GPTBridge-project-code and may-be-invoked only-by-exact-approved-identity through-C28 governed-executor+cannot receive/store/generate/modify GPTBridge code outside-root; DATA:non-code user data governed-separately+must-never-contain executable-project-code to-evade-boundary\\n\\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
