                                },
                        "field":  "rule",
                        "proposed":  "SCOPE:all channel disconnect/reconnect and every automatic health preservation repair recovery watchdog startup or maintenance action; OWNER:information-layer owns reconnect state and delivery+decision-sovereign classifies failure+decision-sovereign approves repair objective+permission-sovereign validates mutation scope+automation-sovereign alone reviews code change; DISCONNECT:immediately invalidate ready+fence prior session/generation+preserve last acknowledged cursor/outbox/checkpoint+keep unrelated routes and independent tools running; RECONNECT:automatic single-flight+fresh authentication/session/generation+bounded exponential backoff+jitter+circuit breaker+subscription renewal+authoritative snapshot+gap detection+ordered idempotent replay+revision/hash convergence before ready; RECONNECT-IS-NOT-REPAIR:transport/session restoration may not write restore replace regenerate format revert reset checkout merge patch or otherwise mutate source code scripts manifests contracts schemas lockfiles or certified artifacts; AUTOMATIC-REPAIR-CODE-PROHIBITION:no automatic process sovereign agent watchdog maintenance task recovery tool startup routine or learned recipe may overwrite source code or select a code version; CODE-FAULT:quarantine evidence+keep last active certified release+fail closed only affected capability+submit typed change request; any source mutation requires explicit decision assignment+permission proof+system-programming review+versioned candidate+tests+human-authorized certified activation; BASELINE:repair may restore runtime state only from the exact active certified immutable artifact and only when byte-identical digest proves no source change; mismatch means stop and request human decision; PROTECTION:before any permitted repair record path identity+content hash+Git state+active release+rollback proof and after operation prove unchanged source hashes; RECOVERY-SUCCESS:channel current+cursor contiguous+snapshot/revision/hash converged+source tree and active release hashes unchanged+stability window passed\\n\\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
                    },
                    {
                        "table":  "articles",
                        "key":  {
                                    "provision_id":  "C40"
                                },
                        "field":  "rule",
                        "proposed":  "SCOPE:all automatic repair health preservation recovery startup watchdog maintenance learned recipe and governed repair execution; SUCCESSOR:C39 refined so automatic repair may perform only evidence-bounded minimal repair and never replacement or reset; OWNER:decision-sovereign diagnoses+decision-sovereign manages repair evidence while permission-sovereign grants exact path/action scope+automation-sovereign reviews any code repair method+governed executor applies+independent verifier accepts; REPAIR-DEFINITION:minimal localized correction to the identified defect while preserving unaffected bytes structure history configuration user work and active certified release; REQUIRED-BEFORE:exact fault code+root-cause evidence+target allowlist+before hash+Git index/worktree state+backup/checkpoint+patch plan+rollback proof+test plan+decision and permission proofs; ALLOWED:smallest deterministic in-place patch limited to authorized defective region+additive compatibility shim+configuration value correction+rebuild generated artifact from its same authoritative source when source itself is unchanged; PROHIBITED-METHOD:whole-file or directory replacement+copy-over+template/default restoration+Git checkout/reset/restore/revert/clean+branch/worktree switching+history rewrite+database snapshot rollback as code repair+package reinstall over source+regeneration that discards edits+delete-and-recreate+blind formatting+LLM whole-file rewrite; UNCOMMITTED-WORK:immutable to automatic repair+overlap means stop and request user decision; PATCH:three-way context+preimage hash+bounded changed lines+atomic write+postimage hash+diff review; FAILURE:patch mismatch test failure scope expansion ambiguity or hash drift=\u003eno mutation or atomic rollback of only this attempted patch+retain evidence; VERIFICATION:syntax/type/contract/focused regression+governance audit+source diff proves only authorized minimal repair+runtime stability window; RECONNECT:transport recovery remains source-nonmutating and cannot invoke code repair merely because a channel disconnected; LEARNING:may propose repair recipe only and cannot widen target choose version or execute without current proof\\n\\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
                    },
                    {
                        "table":  "articles",
                        "key":  {
                                    "provision_id":  "C47"
                                },
                        "field":  "rule",
                        "proposed":  "OBJECTIVES:maximize stable availability+reduce preventable faults+minimize detection/containment/recovery time+preserve bounded execution latency+guarantee owner-local blast radius; OWNER:runtime-sovereign owns continuity+decision-sovereign owns health classification and reliability priorities+decision-sovereign manages repair verification+permission-sovereign owns exact authority+automation-sovereign owns budgets and resource allocation and manages resource modules+information-layer owns cross-layer signals; SLO:each capability declares availability+latency p50/p95/p99+throughput+error rate+queue age+resource headroom+fault budget+detection deadline+containment deadline+recovery objective+stability window; PREVENTION:typed contracts+bounded resources+dependency timeouts+bulkheads+circuit breakers+backpressure+admission control+idempotency+checkpointing+preflight+fault injection+capacity margin; SPEED:critical-path priority+parallel independent work+event-driven waits+bounded payloads+cache with freshness proof+no duplicate probes+no busy polling+deadline propagation+load shed noncritical work before control degradation; REPAIR:detect\u003eclassify exact fault code\u003eisolate\u003epreserve state/evidence\u003eselect registered manual\u003epermission check\u003ebounded minimal repair with no overwrite/reset\u003eindependent verification\u003estability window\u003eclose or escalate; REPAIR-LIMIT:no self-modification of source+no authority expansion+no repeated ineffective repair+failure budget and circuit breaker; ISOLATION:per-individual process+generation+queue+pool+quota+session+data+logs+repair+update+shutdown and shared dependency tenant/bulkhead; CASCADE-PREVENTION:one owner failure cannot restart+stop+mutate+starve+lower health verdict of another; MEASUREMENT:every release compares baseline/regression and blocks activation on reliability or latency regression beyond declared budget\\n\\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
                    },
