                        "proposed":  "VERSION-NAMESPACES:codex-version+application-version+tool-version+release-id+contract-version+runtime-generation are-distinct+typed+non-interchangeable; APPLICATION-VERSION-AUTHORITY:permission-sovereign-published-record-in-permission-directory; ACTIVE-RUNTIME-AUTHORITY:D29-active-certified-release-pointer; CODEX-VERSION-AUTHORITY:official-codex-only; TOOL-VERSION-AUTHORITY:each-tool-certified-manifest; CONTRACT-VERSION-AUTHORITY:registered-information-layer-contract; AUTOMATIC-REPAIR+LEARNING+MODEL+AI-REASONING:may-read-typed-version-evidence+may-report-mismatch+may-propose-candidate but-may-not-infer/normalize/convert/increment/decrement/select/rewrite/publish/repair/version-or-release-identity; COMPARISON:exact-namespace+canonical-format+issuer+certificate+content-root; STRING-ORDER+FLOAT+SEMVER-CONVERSION+DISPLAY-VERSION+mtime+Git-HEAD+package-default forbidden-as-runtime-authority; MISMATCH-CLASSIFICATION:unknown|metadata-drift|artifact-drift|contract-incompatible|certificate-invalid|release-pointer-invalid; ON-MISMATCH:freeze-affected-mutation+preserve-active-code+collect-evidence+information-layer\u003emaintenance-health-classification\u003edecision; METADATA-ONLY-DRIFT:permission-sovereign-decision+governed-metadata-correction+no-code-write; ARTIFACT-DRIFT:repair-byte-identical-to-active-certified-artifact-root-only; NEW-CODE-REQUIRED:automation-sovereign candidate\u003eD28 certification+atomic-release; INVALID-OR-AMBIGUOUS-EVIDENCE:fail-closed+no-reset+user-notification; AUTOMATIC-REPAIR-INPUT:immutable active-release-id+certificate-digest+artifact-root+target-path+expected-hash+operation-scope; AUTOMATIC-REPAIR-OUTPUT:before-hash+after-hash+release-id-unchanged+verification; VERSION-CHANGE:explicit-candidate+permission-sovereign publication+release-recertification only; DISPLAY-VERSION:presentation-only+never-decision-source\\n\\nPACKAGE-AUTO-DEFER:每24小時偵測一次。未具明確新增套件許可者自動標記DEFERRED_AWAITING_PERMISSION；一般新版發布未滿14日者自動標記DEFERRED_OBSERVATION_WINDOW。遞延不等於拒絕、通過或已安裝，遞延期間禁止下載、安裝、鎖定或執行；條件成熟後於下一次週期自動重新評估。重大安全或相容性事件得立即加跑受管檢查。"
                    },
