                        "proposed":  "SCOPE:application+tool+contract+artifact versions+build+certification+activation+hot update+hot reload+rollback; OWNER:automation-sovereign owns-domain decisions and manages version/release modules while permission-sovereign owns directory registration; IDENTITY:CODEX_RELEASE_VERSION_SPECIAL_LAW+section-17+immutable provision identities; AUTHORITY:codex+A60+D40 with special-over-general precedence only-inside-declared-scope; INPUT:registered directory identities+current version+permission proof+owner evidence; RULE:one accountable owner+typed decisions+governed executor only+no cross-domain authority; RELATIONSHIPS:permission-special-law+version-release-artifact-directory+test-flow-directory+runtime-special-law; LIFECYCLE:register\u003evalidate\u003eactivate\u003eoperate\u003eobserve\u003erepair-or-rollback\u003eretire with versioned lineage; VALIDATION:identity+owner+scope+schema+relationships+permission+runtime generation+evidence all current; FAILURE:retain last verified release and roll back only exact owner; EVIDENCE:integer version rule+artifact hash+compatibility+tests+staged activation+health window+rollback evidence"
