                        "field":  "rule",
                        "proposed":  "TEST-OWNERSHIP:owner=permission-sovereign in test_flow_directory and test_suite_architecture_directory means directory identity,schema,access and lifecycle authority only. decision-sovereign is centralized management_owner for one-module-one-suite inventory,planning,scheduling,fixtures,execution coordination,evidence collection,retest and status reporting;it has no policy decision or direct module execution power and dispatches governed module test executors. A test flow without a physical management_owner field resolves it through its suite/module registry and this provision;unresolved mapping is incomplete evidence. Domain owners define expected domain truth/evidence but cannot self-register or suppress results. TEST-ACTIVATION:test suite status mandated means required but not proven active. A suite becomes active only through module path existence,ownership,language-appropriate unit tests,pytest integration when applicable,fixtures,isolation,cleanup,current passing evidence and maintenance-manager acceptance. Counts are always computed from current registries and never frozen into rules. ROSTERS:top current institution roster and active sub-sovereign roster are separate registry-derived views. TOP={decision-sovereign,system-runtime-sovereign,automation-sovereign,permission-sovereign,星澄};Codex is excluded. SUB is exactly the active children in sovereign_hierarchy_registry whose lineage/lifecycle/effective state and parent are consistent. Displaying a generic active lineage query as the top roster is forbidden. HISTORICAL-CORRECTION:H045 damaged display token is corrected by immutable annotation to confidential 星澄 audit;original history bytes,entry_hash,sequence and authority remain unchanged. Consumers display the annotation with raw evidence. DYNAMIC-PENDING:directory implementation,all test suites,external signatures,Epoch human signature and Language Governance lifecycle are read live from their canonical registries. pending/mandated/signature-required/FREEZE-PENDING remains a real blocker until its own acceptance evidence and immutable transition record pass. A count,report date or prior audit cannot be used as permanent current state. STATUS-SNAPSHOT:reports may state counts only with source revision,registry hash,generated_at and stale-after;after expiry or registry change they are observations,not rules."
                    },
